{"unit_id":"home-i__dsh-window-size#card-zh","repo":"home-i/dsh-window-size","commit":"a993fa14be2c3e67a33bd7f0c08c6a63d809d608","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-window-size 是一款 DSH 桌面端插件，在 Host 启动时恢复并居中窗口尺寸，并在设置页提供尺寸控制。它由 Host 插件读取持久化记录、调用 Windows 窗口接口调整窗口，客户端设置页通过 RPC 提交操作。主要功能包括记住手动调整后的尺寸、按记录恢复、设置宽高并立即应用、切换启动居中和启用状态，以及立即居中或恢复默认尺寸。适合希望重启后保持桌面窗口布局的 Windows 用户。使用需要 Windows 上的 DSH 桌面版，不需要 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:28-40","window-memory.js:242-284","window-memory.js:340-428","client.js:462-480"]}
{"unit_id":"home-i__dsh-window-size#card-en","repo":"home-i/dsh-window-size","commit":"a993fa14be2c3e67a33bd7f0c08c6a63d809d608","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-window-size restores DSH Desktop window dimensions at launch through Windows APIs. Its Settings page can apply, reapply, or reset sizes, center the window, and toggle automatic memory. It suits Windows Desktop users and needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:28-40","window-memory.js:242-284","window-memory.js:340-428","client.js:462-480"]}
