{"unit_id":"home-i__dsh-window-size#feature-1","repo":"home-i/dsh-window-size","commit":"a993fa14be2c3e67a33bd7f0c08c6a63d809d608","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-window-size 的功能「启动恢复尺寸」：Host 启动后读取已保存的窗口尺寸并应用；没有记录时使用配置的默认宽高。手动调整尺寸也会在窗口变化稳定后记录，供下次启动恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["window-memory.js:245-273"]}
