{"unit_id":"home-i__dsh-window-size#feature-3","repo":"home-i/dsh-window-size","commit":"a993fa14be2c3e67a33bd7f0c08c6a63d809d608","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-window-size 的功能「窗口居中」：可在设置页切换启动恢复时是否居中，也可立即将当前窗口置于显示器工作区中央，保持现有尺寸。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:426-443","window-memory.js:366-382","window-memory.js:225-239"]}
